// The bard picks one song per visit from a line group: the most specific
// song that fits first, then whichever has been heard least.

title: Bard
---
<<if visited("Bard")>>
    Bard: Back for an encore? #line:bard_encore
<<else>>
    Bard: A song for the house! #line:bard_intro
<<endif>>
=> Bard: ♪ Oh, the lantern burns so bright tonight... ♪ #line:song_lantern
=> Bard: ♪ The miller's ghost goes round and round... ♪ #line:song_mill
=> Bard: ♪ Here's to the traveller, {$coins} coins to spend! ♪ <<if $coins > 0>> #line:song_coins
Bard: Thank you, thank you! #line:bard_thanks
<<set $after_song to true>>
<<jump Menu>>
===
